<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 13.05 to 5979.81.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 0.58 to 374.74, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.07.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1208 to 1123.</p>
<p>Volume was 380,740,160, compared with 463,882,290 Friday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
